# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) if you want the AI features. Nothing else needs it:
# the test suite skips the AI layers without a key, and the demo's canvas,
# analyzer, inspector and patch engine never call a model at all.
#
# The key is read by the Vite dev server and added to the request there — it is
# never exposed through `import.meta.env` and never reaches the browser bundle.
# The hosted demo has no server, so it asks the visitor for their own key
# instead; see apps/demo/src/ai.ts.

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# Free reasoning model the conformance evals were measured on.
OPENROUTER_MODEL=stealth/ox-alpha
